WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.130
("Discoplosion")

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.220
- Hi, my name is Sylvia Yoo.

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.470
I'm the chef and owner of Churro Burrough

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:10.430
here in Los Angeles.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.510
This has been a project
long in the making.

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:16.762
I have gone to culinary school in New York

00:00:16.762 --> 00:00:20.030
and came back to Los
Angeles and decided that

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:21.990
instead of working in another restaurant

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:23.900
I wanted to do something for myself.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.918
So for me I thought of it more like

00:00:27.918 --> 00:00:29.990
what are components that
go really well together.

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.160
A lot of times you want
something that's warm,

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.500
and cold and something with texture.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.830
Something that's smooth.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.710
So kind of digging into my
memories and things like that,

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.170
the churro kind of came up in my head

00:00:41.170 --> 00:00:42.300
more often than once.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.420
It has that crispy
factor, that flaky factor,

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:48.525
has a lightness to it, but
a heaviness to it as well,

00:00:48.525 --> 00:00:51.010
and it balances and pairs
really well with ice cream.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.350
("Discoplosion")

00:01:07.190 --> 00:01:09.280
So one day I decided to make
some churros for my family

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.410
and decided to put a
scoop of ice cream on it

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:12.410
and it tasted really good.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:16.040
And after weeks and months
of research and development

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.290
the churro ice cream sandwich came about.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:21.994
We make everything in house,

00:01:21.994 --> 00:01:23.800
a small batch from scratch.

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.372
And it really ensures the quality

00:01:25.372 --> 00:01:27.260
and the freshness of what we do.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:30.760
("Discoplosion")

